      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MindWanderer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/48/4816_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MindWanderer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I do feel like they captured Harpy’s frustration well in the game.&nbsp; I always start off trying to be careful and take advantage of high magic, and inevitably end up saying, “Eh, this is too hard.&nbsp; F* it, BIRDS!”</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This, 100%. Staying high arcane takes a good bit of luck and playing more support than wading into the fight. But birds? Birds are everyone’s friend. By which I mean everyone will get a bird, whether they want it or not. :V</p>",
