      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TheBazaarClerk\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thebazaarclerk/48/2156_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TheBazaarClerk:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Not a fan of Harpmist. Mentor/Student romances are really not my thing.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>They are also super unethical, super problematic, and super counterproductive to the whole mentoring thing.</p>",
