      "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:53:52.377Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Interesting how extremely this episode gets reconnected over the course of the podcast; they said here that Harpy didn’t have nemeses of her own until she became Pinion, whereas by the time RCR came out for DE, there were so many stories about the Fey Court, not one of which had even been hinted at at this point in the double digits of podcast episodes, that she would up a nemesis for Dagda and the Morrigan.</p>",
